{
  "note": "1h confirm uses ~130 calendar days of candles. 15m is the venue cap of ~5000 bars (~52 days). 5m is ~17 days. No historical aggressor tape, so order-flow gates are off in this book and on in paper/live. R is net PnL divided by size times the price-stop distance. Stops are often 25-50 bps, so the 25/30 bp slip allowance makes a stopped trade about -2 price-R while the dollar loss stays near the 1% budget. Drawdown is mark-to-market to the bar close, flattened with that same slippage. Paper/live does not accrue funding; this replay does. Baseline exits on the 16-trade book: 10 stops, 5 targets, 1 max-hold. Median stop width 32 bps. min_r 1.5 and 1.67 matched the baseline trade list, so every baseline target was already at least 1.67R. A zero-trade config is not ranked as an edge.",
